>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `audit`

``` hol4
seedAudit.audit : {waivers : seedAudit.waiver list} -> seedAudit.report
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Checks inversion and preservation obligations for every safe rule in the
assembled claset, and validates all persistent split rules.

The fixed prover stack runs each nontrivial obligation for at most five
seconds.  A waiver needs a unique rule name, a reason, and a date.  A stale
waiver is an error: waivers may explain only obligations that still fail the
fixed stack.

### Failure

Raises a HOL error for any unwaivered failure or stale waiver.

### See also

[`clasetLib.the_claset`](#clasetLib.the_claset),
[`seedCollections.algebra_ss`](#seedCollections.algebra_ss)
